The following example shows an HTTP trigger [JavaScript function](functions-reference-node#http-triggers). The function looks for a `name` parameter either in the query string or the body of the [HTTP request](functions-reference-node?tabs=javascript&amp;pivots=nodejs-model-v4#http-request).

